Value Filldown,Required ZONE (\S+)
Value Required INTERFACE (\S+)

# "display security-zone": each zone and its member interfaces, one row per member
# ("None": no member). Traffic between zones is denied unless a security policy permits
# it, whatever the packet-filter default action.
Start
  ^Name:\s+${ZONE}\s*$$
  ^Members:\s*$$
  ^\s+None\s*$$
  ^\s+${INTERFACE}(?:\s+.*)?$$ -> Record
  ^\s*$$
  ^.* -> Error "unrecognized display security-zone line"
